---
import ExtDownload from '../../../components/ExtDownload'
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import './styles.scss'
---

<html lang="en" style="--bg-color: var(--bg-yellow)">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon/favicon-96x96.png" sizes="96x96" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon/favicon.ico" />
		<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/favicon/apple-touch-icon.png" />
		<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="〈物語〉" />
		<link rel="manifest" href="/favicon/site.webmanifest" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Monogatari Series - Short Story Downloads</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Here you'll find information about the Monogatari Series light novels, the anime adaptation and more!" />
		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<meta property="og:title" content="〈物語〉Monogatari Series - Short Story Downloads" />
		<meta property="og:description" content="Here you'll find information about the Monogatari Series light novels, the anime adaptation and more!" />
		<meta property="og:url" content="https://monogatariseri.es/" />
		<meta property="og:image" content="https://monogatari-series.vercel.app/banners/ln-downloads.jpg" />
		<meta property="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
		<meta property="twitter:url" content="https://monogatariseri.es/" />
		<meta property="twitter:title" content="〈物語〉Monogatari Series - Short Story Downloads" />
		<meta property="twitter:description" content="Here you'll find information about the Monogatari Series light novels, the anime adaptation and more!" />
		<meta property="twitter:image" content="https://monogatari-series.vercel.app/banners/ln-downloads.jpg" />
	</head>
	<body style={`--position: top`}>
		<Layout>
			<main>
				<div class="section">
					<div class="cover">
						<a href="/covers/lns/en/mijikanamonogatari.png" target="_blank">Full resolution</a>
						<picture>
							<source srcset="/covers/lns/en/mijikanamonogatari.avif" type="image/avif" />
							<source srcset="/covers/lns/en/mijikanamonogatari.webp" type="image/webp" />
							<img src="/covers/lns/en/mijikanamonogatari.png" alt="">
						</picture>
					</div>
					<div class="info">
						<div class="subtitle">
							短物語
						</div>
						<div class="title">
							<h3>Short Stories</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="links">
							<h4>Links</h4>
							<ul>
								<span class="sub">Japanese</span>
								<li>Mijikanamonogatari [EPUB] (JPN) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/b9ku33.epub' name='短物語.epub' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/%E7%9F%AD%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E.epub" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
								<li>Mijikanamonogatari [PDF] (JPN) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/y726ab.pdf' name='短物語.pdf' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/%E7%9F%AD%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E.pdf" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
								<li>Manga Short Stories 1, 5 - 22 [PDF] (JPN) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/3j80nd.zip' name='Manga Short Stories [PDF] (JPN).zip' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/Manga%20Short%20Stories%20%5BPDF%5D%20(JPN).zip" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
								<li>Mazemonogatari [EPUB] (JPN) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/mieo9k.epub' name='混物語.epub' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/%E6%B7%B7%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E.epub" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
								<span class="sub">English</span>
								<li>Mijikanamonogatari [EPUB] (ENG) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/ulx5ee.epub' name='MIJIKANAMONOGATARI_20250321.epub' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jC-sfRaltT7KLf7H7kok8GJcCNqduBqs/view?usp=drive_link" target="_blank">[Drive]</a></li>
								<li>Mijikanamonogatari [PDF] (ENG) <ExtDownload href="https://files.catbox.moe/7x1r4k.pdf" name="MIJIKANAMONOGATARI_20250321.pdf" client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/MIJIKANAMONOGATARI_20250321.pdf" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
								<li>Mazemonogatari [EPUB] (ENG) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/l14zu7.epub' name='MAZEMONOGATARI_20250321.epub' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/MAZEMONOGATARI_20250321.epub" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
								<li>Mazemonogatari [PDF] (ENG) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/0z5k4o.pdf' name='MAZEMONOGATARI_20250321.pdf' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/MAZEMONOGATARI_20250321.pdf" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
								<span class="sub">Portuguese (Brazil)</span>
								<li>Mijikanamonogatari [PDF] (PT-BR) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/q0zjs6.pdf' name='AAA. Mijikanamonogatari - Conto de Anedotas (2024.12.12).pdf' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/AAA.%20Mijikanamonogatari%20-%20Conto%20de%20Anedotas%20(2024.12.12).pdf" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
								<li>Manga Short Stories + Extra Stories [PDF] (PT-BR) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/wrxk4a.pdf' name='BBB. Contos de Coleções (2024.12.12).pdf' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/BBB.%20Contos%20de%20Cole%C3%A7%C3%B5es%20(2024.12.12).pdf" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
								<li>Mazemonogatari [PDF] (PT-BR) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/0h4ree.pdf' name='CCC. Mazemonogatari - Conto de Misturas (2026.08.04).pdf' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/CCC.%20Mazemonogatari%20-%20Conto%20de%20Misturas%20(2026.08.04).pdf" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
								<li>Tsukimonogatari (Tsubasa Lion) [PDF] (PT-BR) <ExtDownload href='https://files.catbox.moe/gufb48.pdf' name='DDD. Tsukimonogatari - Conto de Períodos (2026.08.04).pdf' client:idle>[Direct]</ExtDownload> <a href="https://file.garden/afE1MkDycVrE3Bhr/DDD.%20Tsukimonogatari%20-%20Conto%20de%20Per%C3%ADodos%20(2026.08.04).pdf" target="_blank">[Mirror]</a></li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div class="notes">
							<h4>Notes</h4>
							<p>The English version of Mijikanamonogatari contains <em>almost</em> every story ever released up to Yotsugi Song (2024), including the manga short stories.</p>
							<p>In the case of the Portuguese version, it was divided into four separate books.</p>
							<p>A Spanish compilation of short stories is coming soon by <a href="https://lordsacar.wordpress.com/category/novelas-ligeras/" target="_blank">Monogatarianos TL</a>.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</main>
		</Layout>
	</body>
</html>
